        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jennifer Ventimilia, Joshua Sternin, Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Dave Pressler\n- TV Series and Episodes: The Simpsons, \"Simpson Tide\", \"'Round Springfield\", Robot and Monster\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n\nFacts:\n- \"'Round Springfield\" is the 22nd episode of the sixth season of The Simpsons.\n- Jennifer Ventimilia co-wrote the The Simpsons episode \"Simpson Tide\" with Joshua Sternin.\n- Jennifer Ventimilia wrote the teleplay for the The Simpsons episode \"'Round Springfield\" from a story idea by Al Jean and Mike Reiss.\n- Dave Pressler created and produced the short-lived Nickelodeon series Robot and Monster with Joshua Sternin and Jennifer Ventimilia.\n- Dave Pressler is perhaps best known for the Emmy-nominated series Robot and Monster.",
